                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Kilia ke "ne: ihtik ... Ne:chmakaskia pahti" kilia "seki, eski se: kokoxkeh tikpiah ne: kalihtik ne: nehjó:n</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
